OL,3,GNEWSALucy Letby inquiry to publish
OL,4,Afindings into how nurse was able to
OL,5,Amurder seven babies
OL,6,
OL,7,FA public inquiry into how Lucy Letby
OL,8,Fwas able to murder seven babies and
OL,9,Fattempt to kill seven more will publish
OL,10,Fits report at 12:30 BST
OL,12,FThe Thirlwall Inquiry has explored
OL,13,Fwhether bosses at the Countess of
OL,14,FChester Hospital - where Letby worked
OL,15,Fas a neonatal nurse - failed to act
OL,16,Ffast enough
OL,18,FThe inquiry was not tasked with
OL,19,Fexamining Letby's guilt and instead
OL,20,Finvestigated how concerns about Letby
OL,21,Fwere handled and whether action could
OL,22,Fhave been taken sooner to stop her
